### Secret key with a custom Postgres role

{{ tffile "examples/resources/supabase_apikey/custom_role.tf" }}

The role must already exist in the project's database. Changing a configured role replaces the key, which issues a new secret. Removing `secret_jwt_template` from the configuration keeps the key and its current role. A role can only be set on a secret key.

